@startuml CU-24
actor "Cajero / Encargado de sucursal" as Csh
boundary "«UI» Angular (POS)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /payments, /sales" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» PaymentService / ReceiptService / Sale / Payment / Receipt" as Model

Csh -> UI : Confirma el cobro de la venta
UI -> Ctrl : POST /payments/confirm
Ctrl -> Model : payment_service.confirm(db)
Model -> Model : sale COMPLETED; genera comprobante (factura CUF-…)
Model --> Ctrl : PaymentRead (COMPLETED) + ReceiptRead
Ctrl --> UI : PaymentRead + ReceiptRead

Csh -> UI : Muestra o descarga el comprobante
UI -> Ctrl : GET /sales/{id}/receipt
Ctrl -> Model : receipt_service.get_for_sale(db, sale)
Model --> Ctrl : ReceiptRead (document_url)
Ctrl --> UI : ReceiptRead
UI --> Csh : Impresión/descarga del comprobante

@enduml